<h1 class="page-title">Alibaba Cloud Model Studio:qwen3-asr-flash</h1>
<div class="doc-status">
Last Updated:Oct 11, 2026
</div>
</header>
<article class="product-description markdown-body">
<div lang="en" class="icms-help-docs-content">
<div lang="en" class="icms-help-docs-content"><p data-tag="shortdesc" class="shortdesc">Qwen3-ASR-Flash is a highly accurate, intelligent, and robust multilingual speech recognition model based on a large language model. Leveraging a powerful foundational model, massive amounts of text and multimodal data, and tens of millions of hours of audio data, Qwen3-ASR-Flash achieves high-precision speech recognition. It can automatically determine the language and accurately recognize speech in multiple languages, ensuring precise transcription even in complex audio environments.</p><h2 id="inference-service-provider">Inference Service Provider <span id="h-490b2834e6"></span></h2>
<p>The inference service provider for <code>qwen3-asr-flash</code> is Alibaba Cloud Model Studio.</p>
<h2 id="model-capabilities">Model Capabilities <span id="h-77230e94b5"></span></h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Capability</th><th>Support</th><th>Capability</th><th>Support</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>Input Modality</p></td><td><p><strong>Audio</strong></p></td><td><p>Output Modality</p></td><td><p><strong>Text</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Model Experience</p></td><td><p>Unsupported</p></td><td><p>Function Calling</p></td><td><p>Unsupported</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Structured Outputs</p></td><td><p>Unsupported</p></td><td><p>Web Search</p></td><td><p>Unsupported</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Prefix Completion</p></td><td><p>Unsupported</p></td><td><p>Context Caching</p></td><td><p>Unsupported</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Batch Inference</p></td><td><p>Unsupported</p></td><td><p>Fine-tuning</p></td><td><p>Unsupported</p></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2 id="context-limits">Context Limits <span id="h-01b911f555"></span></h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>Max Input Length</p></td><td><p>—</p></td><td><p>Max Output Length</p></td><td><p>—</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Context Window</p></td><td><p>—</p></td><td><p></p></td><td><p></p></td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2 id="pricing">Pricing <span id="h-64ff4bce85"></span></h2>
<p>This page only shows the original pricing for model API calls, excluding any limited-time promotions. Visit <a href="https://modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com/ap-southeast-1/model/market">Model Studio Console</a> for promotional offers.</p>
<section data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" id="sec-tabs" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="china-beijing" class="section"><h4 id="china-beijing-h4">China (Beijing)</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Billing Item</th><th>Price (USD)</th><th>Unit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>Audio Duration</p></td><td><p>0.000032</p></td><td><p>Per second</p></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section id="singapore" class="section"><h4 id="singapore-h4">Singapore</h4><p>Scope: International</p><table><thead><tr><th>Billing Item</th><th>Price (USD)</th><th>Unit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>Audio Duration</p></td><td><p>0.000035</p></td><td><p>Per second</p></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section id="us-virginia" class="section"><h4 id="us-virginia-h4">US (Virginia)</h4><p>Scope: US</p><table><thead><tr><th>Billing Item</th><th>Price (USD)</th><th>Unit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>Audio Duration</p></td><td><p>0.000035</p></td><td><p>Per second</p></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section>
<h2 id="rate-limits">Rate Limits <span id="h-5bab6435a6"></span></h2>
<section data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" id="sec-tabs-2" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="china-beijing-2" class="section"><h4 id="china-beijing-2-h4">China (Beijing)</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>RPM (Requests Per Minute)</p></td><td><p>100</p></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section id="singapore-2" class="section"><h4 id="singapore-2-h4">Singapore</h4><p>Scope: International</p><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>RPM (Requests Per Minute)</p></td><td><p>100</p></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section id="us-virginia-2" class="section"><h4 id="us-virginia-2-h4">US (Virginia)</h4><p>Scope: US</p><table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>RPM (Requests Per Minute)</p></td><td><p>100</p></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></div>
